   "app_description": "FocusPomo is a minimalist, beautiful and professional app based on the \"Pomodoro Technique\". It helps you to stay focused without being distracted and become more productive when you are studying or working.\n\n#Who need FocusPomo#\n1.Low learning efficiency\n2.Easy distraction\n3.Procrastination\n4.Not self-discipline\n5.Learning pressure\n\n#Key Features#\n1.Real-time iCloud Sync across iPhone and iPad\n2.Simple designed Pomodoro timer\n3.Stay focused to get cute tomatoes which support gravity sensor\n4.Productive charts and insights\n5.Track time throughout the day\n6.Minimalist and amazing design\n\n#Other Features#\n- App Whitelist\n- Desktop widgets, Lock Screen widgets, Interactive widgets, Live Activities, Dynamic Island\n- Standby Mode\n- Customizable Countdown\n- Stopwatch with Pause Support\n- Apple Health Synchronization\n- Manual Addition of Focus Time\n- Ad-Free Forever\n- Current Lifetime Membership Plan includes all future updates, including for Watch and Mac\n- Customizable Pomodoro Cycle Numbers, Long Breaks, and Short Breaks\n- Customizable Focus Tags\n- Continuous Optimization for iPad\n\n#Contact and Follow Us#\nIf you have any ideas, please let us know! We are appreciating your help to build FocusPomo better than ever！\n\nInstagram: focuspomo_app\nEmail: amazingwork@126.com\n\nTerms: https://frill-butternut-b24.notion.site/FocusPomo-Terms-a990d3b371e84d9685beb94cefbe5e0e\nPrivacy: https://frill-butternut-b24.notion.site/FocusPomo-Privacy-23f9b9bf3003454581bdd22520508f75",
